WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.304
Roxy watched the strange girl skip down West Street.

2
00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:09.082
"La, la, la, la, la!" the girl sang.

3
00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:13.624
"That girl is shrinking things all over Metro City," thought Roxy.

4
00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:19.131
"I have to stop her before the entire city is gone!"

5
00:00:19.132 --> 00:00:25.109
As Roxy started to fly, she heard a sound.

6
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:29.404
Meow! A cat was looking at something on the sidewalk.

7
00:00:29.405 --> 00:00:33.382
Roxy looked down.

8
00:00:33.383 --> 00:00:36.652
"Tiny people!" Roxy cried.

9
00:00:36.653 --> 00:00:40.443
Small, scared people were running away from the cat.

10
00:00:40.444 --> 00:00:43.846
"Please help!" someone cried.

11
00:00:43.847 --> 00:00:48.197
"That cat is going to eat us!" shouted another person.

12
00:00:48.198 --> 00:00:52.370
Meow! The cat leaped through the air.

13
00:00:52.371 --> 00:00:55.383
Roxy caught the cat before it landed.

14
00:00:55.384 --> 00:01:03.947
"Bad kitty!" she said. "You shouldn't eat people!"

15
00:01:03.948 --> 00:01:10.835
Roxy led the tiny people into a pizza shop.

16
00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:13.537
"Stay here," she said.

17
00:01:13.538 --> 00:01:17.881
"I'm going to stop this shrinking right now!"

18
00:01:17.882 --> 00:01:20.493
Roxy ran back outside.

19
00:01:20.494 --> 00:01:25.855
"Rocket Girl!" screamed a tiny voice. "Help me!"

20
00:01:25.856 --> 00:01:29.017
"Who needs help now?" Roxy wondered.

21
00:01:29.018 --> 00:01:32.528
She looked up and saw a hawk flying away.

22
00:01:32.529 --> 00:01:37.043
Roxy used her super vision.

23
00:01:37.044 --> 00:01:39.179
"Uh-oh!" Roxy cried.

24
00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.049
"That hawk is flying away with a tiny man!"

25
00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:48.125
Roxy shot through the air. Zoom!

26
00:01:48.126 --> 00:01:49.971
"Hand over that little man!"

27
00:01:49.972 --> 00:01:51.879
Roxy yelled at the hawk.

28
00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.601
The hawk dropped the man and flew

29
00:01:54.602 --> 00:01:59.099
away. "Oh no!" the man shouted. "I'm

30
00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:05.123
falling!" Zoom! Roxy flew fast and caught the

31
00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:08.753
man. "Whew!" said Roxy as she

32
00:02:08.754 --> 00:02:10.423
landed.

33
00:02:10.424 --> 00:02:13.568
Crunch! "What was that?" Roxy

34
00:02:13.569 --> 00:02:16.028
wondered. "Hey!" A tiny voice

35
00:02:16.029 --> 00:02:18.865
yelled. "I just bought that

36
00:02:18.866 --> 00:02:21.623
car!" Roxy looked

37
00:02:21.624 --> 00:02:26.548
down. A small smashed car fell from the bottom of her

38
00:02:26.549 --> 00:02:31.339
boot. "Sorry about that!" Roxy

39
00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:34.706
said. Again Roxy leaped into the air and flew

40
00:02:34.707 --> 00:02:39.013
off. "Now I need to find that strange girl," said

41
00:02:39.014 --> 00:02:44.499
Roxy. Roxy flew above Metro

42
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:52.182
City. She looked everywhere, but she didn't see the

43
00:02:52.183 --> 00:02:56.380
girl. "Hmph!" Roxy sat on the roof of a building to

44
00:02:56.381 --> 00:03:01.961
think. Suddenly . . . Whirr! The building under her started

45
00:03:01.962 --> 00:03:04.765
shrinking! And the girl was down on the

46
00:03:04.766 --> 00:03:10.322
street! Roxy leaped off the

47
00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:13.385
building. "What a cute little

48
00:03:13.386 --> 00:03:18.015
building!" The girl giggled and put the building into one of her

49
00:03:18.016 --> 00:03:23.153
pockets. "La, la, la, la!" The girl sang as she skipped down the street.

50
00:03:23.154 --> 00:03:28.964
"Hey!" yelled Roxy. "Stop right there!"

51
00:03:28.965 --> 00:03:33.133
The strange girl looked up and saw Roxy zooming down at her.

52
00:03:33.134 --> 00:03:35.399
The girl looked scared.

53
00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.444
"Oh!" the girl cried. "Oh no!"

54
00:03:39.445 --> 00:03:44.080
The little girl pointed the device at Roxy. Whirr!

55
00:03:44.081 --> 00:03:53.129
"Ahh!" Roxy screamed. "I'm shrinking!"

